  "description": "The SKULLXBONES® Wide Series has arrived — and you know how we roll. Built on an aluminum frame with massive 80mm wide wheels, a triple tree fork, and Shimano Nexus 3-speed drivetrain, the Wide Series is the boldest cruiser on the boardwalks of Huntington Beach. We obsessed over the ergonomics to make sure it rides as good as it looks — and it looks incredible. Ape hanger bars, a threadless 4-banger stem, and a wide stance that commands attention from the pier to the strand.It took a long time to finally get it right, but it was worth the wait.Customize your ride with our bike accessories, or go further with our Electric Beach Cruisers.HBBC… Style Matters… Ride With Us!!Check out the entire SKULLXBONES® family of cruisers! Visit our flagship store — HB Easyrider at 328 Main Street in Downtown Huntington Beach!🛠️ Specs",
